ial AI, image classification"}]]}]},{"heading":"Cartography Fundamentals to Master","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional cartographer should understand map projections."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geographic coordinates"},{"text":"UTM"},{"text":"Web Mercator"},{"text":"Equal-area projections"},{"text":"Conformal projections"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand that choosing a projection depends on the purpose of the map."},{"type":"h","text":"Also learn cartographic principles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Colour selection"},{"text":"Symbolisation"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Label placement"},{"text":"Scale"},{"text":"Generalisation"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Metadata"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A technically correct GIS map can still be a poor cartographic product if it communicates information badly."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are highly valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS companies"},{"text":"Mapping companies"},{"text":"Survey companies"},{"text":"Urban-planning firms"},{"text":"Environmental consultancies"},{"text":"Infrastructure companies"},{"text":"Transportation companies"},{"text":"Remote-sensing organisations"},{"text":"Government geospatial organisations"},{"text":"Disaster-management organisations"},{"text":"Real-estate analytics companies"},{"text":"Defence/geospatial organisations"},{"text":"Research institutions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS Intern"},{"text":"Cartography Intern"},{"text":"Mapping Intern"},{"text":"Geospatial Intern"},{"text":"Remote Sensing Intern"},{"text":"GIS Research Intern"},{"text":"Spatial Data Intern"},{"text":"Urban GIS Intern"},{"text":"Geospatial Data Analyst Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Build a Professional GIS Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For cartography, showing actual maps is extremely important."},{"type":"p","text":"Create a portfolio with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Population Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a professional choropleth map."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Urban Infrastructure Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Public facilities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Environmental Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Forest cover"},{"text":"Water bodies"},{"text":"Pollution"},{"text":"Protected areas"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Remote-Sensing Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Perform:"},{"type":"h","text":"Land-use/land-cover classification"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Change Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"h","text":"Urban expansion / deforestation / water-body change"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Interactive Web Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a browser-based map using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leaflet"},{"text":"GeoJSON"},{"text":"OpenStreetMap or another appropriate basemap"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 7 — Spatial Planning Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"h","text":"Best locations for a new public facility"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Road accessibility"},{"text":"Existing facilities"},{"text":"Land use"},{"text":"Distance constraints"}]}]},{"heading":"Tools to Learn","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"p","text":"QGIS\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"},{"type":"p","text":"ArcGIS Pro\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel\n⭐⭐⭐⭐"},{"type":"p","text":"Python\n⭐⭐⭐⭐"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL/PostGIS\n⭐⭐⭐⭐"},{"type":"h","text":"Remote sensing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Earth Engine"},{"text":"SNAP"},{"text":"ERDAS/other remote-sensing software where available"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Web GIS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leaflet"},{"text":"GeoJSON"},{"text":"Mapbox concepts"},{"text":"ArcGIS Online"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GeoPandas"},{"text":"Shapely"},{"text":"Rasterio"},{"text":"Folium"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to master every software package. QGIS + one commercial GIS platform + Python + SQL is an excellent foundation."}]},{"heading":"GIS Data Quality","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Professional cartographers need to understand that spatial data can contain errors."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Positional accuracy"},{"text":"Attribute accuracy"},{"text":"Completeness"},{"text":"Consistency"},{"text":"Resolution"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Coordinate-system errors"},{"text":"Topological errors"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand common GIS problems such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Overlapping polygons"},{"text":"Gaps"},{"text":"Invalid geometries"},{"text":"Duplicate features"},{"text":"Wrong projections"},{"text":"Missing attributes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This separates a professional GIS analyst from someone who only knows how to make maps."}]},{"heading":"Jobs After BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry roles"},{"type":"table","header":["Job Title","Alignment"],"rows":[[{"text":"Junior Cartographer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"GIS Technician"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"GIS Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Mapping Technician"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"GIS Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Mapping Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Geospatial Technician"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Junior Geospatial Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"GIS Data Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Remote Sensing Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Spatial Data Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Digital Mapping Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"